Enhancement: speed up the processing time of ``restic find`` about 3-20 times

In the past, restic find used ``walker.Walk`` to gather its result data.
``find`` now used ``data.StreamTrees`` to gather its result data and does it faster
because it calls ``data.StreamTrees`` only twice, instead of calling ``walker.Walk``
as many times as the number of snapshots selected.

